<XDFFORMAT version="1.70">
<XDFHEADER>
  <deftitle>4B0906018CM</deftitle>
  <description>ASAP2 DAMOS 24HGCM8g, software 0008. File offsets are ECU addresses minus 0x800000. A 16-bit axis or body that would start on an odd byte is stored at the next even byte. The A2L dataset is 24HG/Dst01 and the paired hex EPK is 24HGCM8.</description>
</XDFHEADER>
